This product includes software developed by Rafael Pesquera
(https://github.com/digitaino) for delivering NWS EMWIN weather products
over MeshCore LoRa mesh networks.

Weather data is derived from National Weather Service EMWIN products
(public domain, US federal government). NWS text products are parsed with
pyIEM (MIT License, Copyright Iowa State University / Daryl Herzmann).
